{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269f3jTtBWte1795246037.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新幾內亞航空一架客機由香港前往巴布亞新幾內亞途中引擎起火，安全急降菲律賓。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.HK-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026f72n4rWwBW1795246064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>客機在菲律賓南部達沃國際機場降落後，機內乘客被疏散。涉事的是巴布亞新幾內亞國家航空公司新幾內亞航空波音767-383ER客機，載著137名乘客與9名機組人員，由香港起飛，原定前往巴布亞新幾內亞，飛行途中疑似右引擎起火，轉飛菲律賓急降。</p><p></p><p>菲律賓民航局表示，未接獲受傷報告，將向受影響乘客與機組人員提供協助及住宿。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:43:49.778929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:37:41.579052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:14.114271+00:00","content_hash":"792939bb745f9b8b3f8bbbffab023a0a8ff2c0a088b3440b9fe43c8e78c1db99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}